kson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"ft6I8fOrKQtVdM_trVXk8A","review_id":"srmcy_uhvUjB_Z9qd6SLiw","date":"2012-11-29T17:20:44","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9474875926971436,"text_excerpt":"My favorite sushi place in NOLA thus far especially for special rolls. When you take in to account price, freshness, atmosphere, service-- Origami comes out on top in my book. I have been here for lunch and dinner and it is awesome. Lunch they have a super good sushi special where for around the bargain price of $10 you get a salad, miso, and 3 basic rolls. Who can beat that? Always a guaranteed nice lunch. Dinner has been awesome too, they have really really yummy special house rolls and unlike other places you feel like you are definitely getting what you pay for. They also always accommodate requests (like taking cream cheese out of rolls etc.). They even give you warm towels at the be..."},{"business_id":"ft6I8fOrKQtVdM_trVXk8A","review_id":"F9YO5kNGccq4J0NMFl-2Ww","date":"2013-02-23T00:03:59","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9463421702384949,"text_excerpt":"After searching and searching for a good sushi place in New Orleans, I'm happy to say the search is over! Origami is reasonably priced and generous in proportions. The sushi is always fresh and they have such a wide variety of flavors that I've never experienced at other Japanese restaurants. Among a long list of other things, my boyfriend and I always get the Poke Salad and the Mussels (Sake or Curry? It is always a debate because they're both great!) We recently tried their special, Oyster Shooters, and they were a huge hit at the table. They don't come with cocktail sauce but don't worry, there is plenty of kick! We sent a compliment to the kitchen and the chef came out personally and ..."},{"business_id":"ft6I8fOrKQtVdM_trVXk8A","review_id":"wPVD0i6KeCjXXG62IYJhLA","date":"2015-07-02T04:06:11","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9438554048538208,"text_excerpt":"Origami is in my top 2 places to get sushi in this city. In fact, I like it so much, I don't really even want to tell you about it. My only regret is that I don't get down to Freret Street nearly enough to visit every time I want sushi. I originally went when it was newer and was suggested to go by word of mouth. They seemed to have some service issues when they first opened but all seems to have been resolved and I've had nothing but glowing and happy experiences here ever since. The ambiance is super nice and clean. It's nicer looking than most sushi places but not trendy-looking and still perfectly casual. The sushi chefs seems to be really accommodating for custom sushi arrangements o..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"ft6I8fOrKQtVdM_trVXk8A","photo_id":"K2S56RFsCY2zHZr-ujZa9w","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/K2S56RFsCY2zHZr-ujZa9w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8838917016983032},{"business_id":"ft6I8fOrKQtVdM_trVXk8A","photo_id":"Tyqe7_4YakBh1mZsLY1DcQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/Tyqe7_4YakBh1mZsLY1DcQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8466113805770874},{"business_id":"ft6I8fOrKQtVdM_trVXk8A","photo_id":"zcBqv0efAWJ5-f0XmChJeg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/zcBqv0efAWJ5-f0XmChJeg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8407183885574341},{"business_id":"ft6I8fOrKQtVdM_trVXk8A","photo_id":"9ODYUBmqz-3qKfCQIkntlA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/9ODYUBmqz-3qKfCQIkntlA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8339784741401672},{"business_id":"ft6I8fOrKQtVdM_trVXk8A","photo_